  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Connectivity and Resilience of the Madhya Pradesh Road Network Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the development of Madhya Pradesh&amp;apos;s road subsector by (i) connecting the less-developed rural population to city and town centers or industrial corridors; (ii) preparing the road subsector development strategy, focusing on emerging areas in the subsector, including climate change resilience, low-carbon development, and road safety; and (iii) creating more opportunities, directly or indirectly, for women in project-influenced areas through enhanced access to markets and other social amenities, as well as in the subsector through the promotion of gender equality and social inclusion (GESI) in the workplace.</narrative>
  </description>
